  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/IMG_2441.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(12 fotos) Herborister&iacute;a Hermanos Gimeno, en la avenida Montendre, 4 de Onda sortea para esta Navidad una cesta con productos naturales de venta en la tienda.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/IMG_2435.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Se sortear&aacute; el lunes 23 de diciembre a las 12 horas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/11/IMG_2463.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Participar&aacute;n en el sorteo todas las personas que depositen en la urna ubicada al efecto los tickets de compra con su nombre, apellidos y n&uacute;mero de tel&eacute;fono.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2435.jpg\" alt=\"img_2435\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2441.jpg\" alt=\"img_2441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2444.jpg\" alt=\"img_2444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2446.jpg\" alt=\"img_2446\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2448.jpg\" alt=\"img_2448\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2449.jpg\" alt=\"img_2449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2452.jpg\" alt=\"img_2452\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2453.jpg\" alt=\"img_2453\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2456.jpg\" alt=\"img_2456\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2459.jpg\" alt=\"img_2459\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2461.jpg\" alt=\"img_2461\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/herboristeriahermanosgimeno/img_2463.jpg\" alt=\"img_2463\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
